silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_10_alternatives_dual_computational_sections_03_computational_algorithmic_concrete_anchor_21_EvidenceRecord#evidencerecord silm:hasLongDescription "The EvidenceRecord is an aboutness record about Mittens; rho:EvidenceRecord->Mittens, witnessing the apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'EvidenceRecord', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
